WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.117
This example creates stay days in the common table expression.

00:00:04.117 --> 00:00:09.412
Each common table expression row represents one completed admission.

00:00:09.412 --> 00:00:16.012
The final query joins patients and calculates admission count and average stay per patient.

00:00:16.012 --> 00:00:19.662
The grain changes only in the final group by.

00:00:19.662 --> 00:00:23.722
That separation makes the transformation easier to validate.
